<task id="218f" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Spaarke's own environments take the canonical SpaarkeMaster too: Deploy-Release imports the CI-published package; the 9-solution list (Deploy-DataverseSolutions.ps1) retires (#1401, ISS-005)</title>
    <phase>Model 1 dedicated-stamp remediation — T218 follow-on; owner decision 2026-10-08</phase>
    <status>pending</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Changes the release path into Spaarke's own environments (demo, dev) and retires an operator script.</rigor-reason>
